{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/triage_request",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "医院需要一处接收区",
      "content": "我是白芷，梦屿中央医院感染科。联络站如果准备接收转移人员，请把普通伤员区、物资区和疑似感染观察区分开。伤员先报名字，再报伤情；不知道姓名就写“身份待确认”，不要写“无名者”。没有专业设备也没关系，稳定照明、干净的水和不会塌的床已经能救人。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "need_list",
          "text": "把最缺的物资分类发给我。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 2,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/supply_list",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "id": "patient_first",
          "text": "我先把伤员安全带回来。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 3,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/patient_first",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "id": "ask_infected",
          "text": "疑似感染的人也送过去吗？",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 1,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/infection_answer",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": {
        "id": "dreamingfishcore:guidance/opening/prepare_triage_area",
        "title": "准备伤员接收与分流区域",
        "content": "在联络站准备普通伤员区、物资区和独立观察区，保证照明、清洁水源、床位和可通行空间。",
        "storyStageId": "dreamingfishcore:afterdream",
        "locationLabel": "玩家联络站医疗区",
        "dimension": "minecraft:overworld",
        "hasLocation": false,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/supply_list",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "按用途准备",
      "content": "按用途分就好：清洁与包扎、照明与供电、饮水与基础食物、保暖与床位、隔离防护、能够密封保存的样本容器。具体物品可以替代，不要为了凑一张漂亮清单耽误接应。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/patient_first",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "先让人抵达",
      "content": "谢谢。路上不要为了抢救一箱物资让不能移动的人单独留下。如果必须取舍，记下丢失物资的位置，我们之后还能找；人的情况可能没有第二次机会。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/infection_answer",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "送到观察区，不要混送",
      "content": "送，但不要与普通伤员混在一起，也不要直接接触体液。提前通知我们，走独立入口。只要对方仍能沟通，就先说明接下来会发生什么；隔离是必要措施，不是处决。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/observation_room",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "第一间观察室",
      "content": "出现了一例需要进一步确认的异常感染反应。请把观察区做成真正能待人的地方：独立出入口、可清洁表面、稳定照明、沟通窗口和基本生活空间。门需要关，但患者仍应该看见人，也应该能够表达疼痛、恐惧和拒绝。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "humane",
          "text": "我会把防护和沟通窗口都做好。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 3,
          "followUpMessageId": "",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        },
        {
          "id": "strict",
          "text": "先确保不会有人误入，再考虑舒适。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 1,
          "followUpMessageId": "",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": {
        "id": "dreamingfishcore:guidance/opening/build_observation_room",
        "title": "完善感染观察室",
        "content": "准备独立出入口、缓冲区、稳定照明、可清洁空间、基本床位和安全沟通窗口。完成状态由服务端或服主确认。",
        "storyStageId": "dreamingfishcore:afterdream",
        "locationLabel": "医院或联络站观察区",
        "dimension": "minecraft:overworld",
        "hasLocation": false,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/after_rescue",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "名单我收到了",
      "content": "转移名单我收到了。我已经把“身份待确认”和“昏迷无法回答”分开记录，也保留了获救者自己补充姓名的位置。谢谢你们没有把他们只写成数字。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/familiar_note",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "纸质时间线",
      "content": "电子记录这两天丢过几次时间戳，我在纸上另外做了患者时间线。不是因为我怀疑谁，只是一次检测只能说明一个时间点。你如果参与观察，请把患者自己说过的话和当时状态一起记下。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": 100,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "keep_context",
          "text": "我会把原话和观察条件一起保存。",
          "minimumFavorability": 100,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 3,
          "followUpMessageId": "",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/trusted_note",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "请帮我检查盲点",
      "content": "我有时担心自己太想保护眼前这个人，会低估其他人承担的风险。你不必总同意我。如果发现我的判断前后不一致，请直接指出来；但也请帮我确认，我们没有因为害怕就把某个人从记录里删掉。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 0,
      "minimumFavorability": 600,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:baizhi/first_stage_protocol",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "这几天的观察",
      "content": "我是白芷，很高兴认识你，我现在在阿拜多斯的学校做医疗志愿，你可以随时来找我。\n\n危机刚刚爆发，根据我最近的观察，目前大家的自愈能力尚未完全消失，但是应该有所下降，光靠进食似乎无法完全恢复自身的健康，需要额外的药品进行辅助。当然了，感染程度以及重生机制都会随着时间流逝缓慢恢复，这一切实在是太突然了，我还需要更多的观察，请多加小心。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 100,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/abydos_arrival",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "到学校来找我",
      "content": "听登记处说你已经到阿拜多斯了。我是白芷，现在在镇上的学校做医疗志愿。安顿好以后过来一趟吧，我想先确认一下你的伤势和感染情况，也有一件关于这里后续安置的事想和你说。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 200,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": {
        "id": "dreamingfishcore:guidance/opening/talk_to_baizhi",
        "title": "去学校找白芷",
        "content": "白芷在阿拜多斯的学校做医疗志愿。找到她并当面交谈。",
        "storyStageId": "dreamingfishcore:dream_beginning",
        "locationLabel": "",
        "dimension": "minecraft:overworld",
        "hasLocation": false,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/baizhi/zhuiguang_contact",
      "npcId": 101,
      "subject": "周岑的联络方式",
      "content": "刚才提到的逐光会，周岑负责登记和筹备。我已经把你的联络请求转给他了；在这里回一句，他会把具体安排讲清楚。是否加入，你听完以后自己决定。",
      "trigger": "MANUAL",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 210,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "contact_zhoucen",
          "text": "好，帮我联系周岑。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 1,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/contact_channel",
          "membershipRequirement": "ANY",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": {
        "id": "dreamingfishcore:guidance/opening/contact_zhoucen",
        "title": "联系周岑",
        "content": "白芷已经当面说明了逐光会的大致情况。回复她的联络消息，接通周岑，听完具体安排后再决定是否加入。",
        "storyStageId": "dreamingfishcore:dream_beginning",
        "locationLabel": "",
        "dimension": "minecraft:overworld",
        "hasLocation": false,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/contact_channel",
      "npcId": 105,
      "subject": "临时联络已经接通",
      "content": "白芷刚刚当面联系了我。我是周岑，现在负责逐光会筹备处。信号不太稳定，长话短说：如果你想知道我们在做什么，就直接回下面那句话，我把目前的安排发给你。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 200,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "NON_MEMBER",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "ask_about_zhuiguang",
          "text": "我是白芷介绍来的，想听听具体安排。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 1,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/introduction",
          "membershipRequirement": "NON_MEMBER",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/introduction",
      "npcId": 105,
      "subject": "人类逐光联合会",
      "content": "逐光会的全称是\"人类逐光联合会\"。眼下医院、维修队、搜救人员，还有愿意替大家多做一点的人，都在各自撑着。我们只是想把这些人和手里的资源接起来，出了事能找到人，物资到了也别在路上耽搁。\n\n现在最要紧的是把基地搭起来，而且不能只是几间勉强挡风的屋子。我们需要一个足够大的地方，让各支队伍能坐下来开会、交换情报、安排救援，也方便登记人员、分发物资和处理临时状况。仓库、救援交接点、能让人安稳过夜的地方，一个都不能少，还得给以后运来的药品和其他物资留出位置。\n\n基地建成后，会有固定的医疗和休整条件，让大家受伤时有地方处理，累了也能喘口气。只是眼下人手和物资都有限，能照顾到的范围还不大。等基础设施和供应逐渐稳定下来，这些安排也会慢慢向周边开放，不会只留给逐光会的成员。\n\n愿意加入的话，我们会把你登记为成员，发一份开工补给，也希望你按自己的能力搭把手，和其他人一起把这件事做起来。暂时不加入也没关系，阿拜多斯的安置、看病和交易不会因为这个把你挡在门外。\n\n这不是替你写好的答案。你可以先到基地看看，把想问的都问清楚，再决定要不要把名字写上去。想好了，就从下面选一个。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 210,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "NON_MEMBER",
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "join_zhuiguang",
          "text": "我愿意加入逐光会，也会参与基地建设。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 3,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/member_welcome",
          "membershipRequirement": "NON_MEMBER",
          "membershipAction": "JOIN"
        },
        {
          "id": "remain_independent",
          "text": "我暂时不加入，先以独立身份留下。",
          "minimumFavorability": -1000,
          "maximumFavorability": 1000,
          "favorabilityDelta": 0,
          "followUpMessageId": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/independent_ack",
          "membershipRequirement": "NON_MEMBER",
          "membershipAction": "NONE"
        }
      ],
      "guidance": {
        "id": "dreamingfishcore:guidance/opening/choose_membership",
        "title": "决定是否加入逐光会",
        "content": "阅读周岑发来的介绍，然后使用消息下方的预设选项作出决定。",
        "storyStageId": "dreamingfishcore:dream_beginning",
        "locationLabel": "",
        "dimension": "minecraft:overworld",
        "hasLocation": false,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "z": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/member_welcome",
      "npcId": 105,
      "subject": "成员登记完成",
      "content": "登记好了，给你的开工补给会马上发到手上。我们正在为逐光会的基地区域选址，选好后我会发消息给你。先用这些物资在阿拜多斯附近休息一会儿吧。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 220,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "MEMBER",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    },
    {
      "id": "dreamingfishcore:opening/zhoucen/independent_ack",
      "npcId": 105,
      "subject": "选择已记录",
      "content": "收到，我把你登记为独立协作者。你不会再收到逐光会内部建设任务；阿拜多斯的安置、医院和普通公共信息照常对你开放。\n\n如果以后改变主意，可以再联系筹备处。现在先照顾好自己。",
      "trigger": "FOLLOW_UP",
      "once": true,
      "priority": 220,
      "minimumFavorability": -1000,
      "maximumFavorability": 1000,
      "membershipRequirement": "NON_MEMBER",
      "replies": [],
      "guidance": null
    }
  ]
